{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50945","headline":"避乱 · 吕从庆","name":"避乱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内风光半血污，杀人声过似樵苏。\n一身驱路忙如蚁，八口无家散若乌。\n栗里无踪空怅望，桃源有梦失招呼。\n饥来野店供飱饭，敢怨匙前脱粟粗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}